      ],
      "en": "Naomi had a relative of her husband’s, a mighty man of wealth, of the family of Elimelech, and his name was Boaz.",
      "ko": "나오미의 남편 엘리멜렉의 친족 중 유력한 자가 있으니 이름은 보아스더라",
      "source_text_hash": "e62c0a8049b4ed05234eb8672029467cd544f94cb7c4c696b6335fb5bbaebe3b",
      "translation_text_hash": "eb00aeeb89d5d7e084dfc9edc03e99ad68e8c520cd54d7ac03943702c0251bca",
