      "en": "Then Boaz said to his servant who was set over the reapers, “Whose young lady is this?”",
      "ko": "보아스가 베는 자들을 거느린 사환에게 이르되 이는 뉘 소녀냐",
      "source_text_hash": "5d32a26aa8802bad420191bb903fb6d0e969c9635b8a2759bcf72b424de6320a",
      "translation_text_hash": "a9e6467d8cd51c3fb5015d44a6a3082d17ca8db87cfb7d211052139d5a97fbd8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "보아스가 베는 자들을 거느린 사환에게 이르되 이는 뉘 소녀냐"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "a9e6467d8cd51c3fb5015d44a6a3082d17ca8db87cfb7d211052139d5a97fbd8"
