      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "RUT",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "Then she fell on her face and bowed herself to the ground, and said to him, “Why have I found favor in your sight, that you should take knowledge of me, since I am a foreigner?”",
      "ko": "룻이 땅에 엎드려 절하며 그에게 이르되 나는 이방 여인이어늘 당신이 어찌하여 내게 은혜를 베푸시며 나를 돌아보시나이까",
      "source_text_hash": "bbdf9385391d5e7ccd7e9f531640598de76de8c548badc9b47e2ce4195c30aa6",
      "translation_text_hash": "442a6aa2959f09ee6f0ff4f8004ac7824d0aaee4272de912cfba0af7f8ed7864",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "룻이 땅에 엎드려 절하며 그에게 이르되 나는 이방 여인이어늘 당신이 어찌하여 내게 은혜를 베푸시며 나를 돌아보시나이까"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "442a6aa2959f09ee6f0ff4f8004ac7824d0aaee4272de912cfba0af7f8ed7864"
