      "en": "At meal time Boaz said to her, “Come here, and eat some bread, and dip your morsel in the vinegar.” She sat beside the reapers, and they passed her parched grain. She ate, was satisfied, and left some of it.",
      "ko": "식사할 때에 보아스가 룻에게 이르되 이리로 와서 떡을 먹으며 네 떡 조각을 초에 찍으라 룻이 곡식 베는 자 곁에 앉으니 그가 볶은 곡식을 주매 룻이 배불리 먹고 남았더라",
      "source_text_hash": "b2ac026434dc0c4cc6c62c0a63054cb2aaf3183d38c133041e0d2fb74c93b88d",
      "translation_text_hash": "03740d9ec03e8aabae9563ecfb0bbf42833d51fe94a3e086837f466e9adcc527",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
